@Customers_HostAddress = http://localhost:5050

### Health Check
GET {{Customers_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Create Customer
POST {{Customers_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-123-4567"
}

### Get Customer By ID (replace GUID with created ID)
GET {{Customers_HostAddress}}/api/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Swagger / OpenAPI Specs
GET {{Customers_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
